msgstr "Instalação do \"UPower\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/upower.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>UPower</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>UPower</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/upower.xml:144
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                   \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release        \\\n"
"      -D gtk-doc=false           \\\n"
"      -D man=false               \\\n"
"      -D systemdsystemunitdir=no \\\n"
"      -D udevrulesdir=/usr/lib/udev/rules.d &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..                   \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release        \\\n"
"      -D gtk-doc=false           \\\n"
"      -D man=false               \\\n"
"      -D systemdsystemunitdir=no \\\n"
"      -D udevrulesdir=/usr/lib/udev/rules.d &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/upower.xml:156
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build               &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build               &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -D gtk-doc=false    \\\n"
"      -D man=false        &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build               &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build               &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -D gtk-doc=false    \\\n"
"      -D man=false        &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/upower.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>LC_ALL=C ninja test</command>. The test"
" suite should be run from a local GUI session started with dbus-launch. On "
"32-bit machines, one test will fail due to rounding errors: "
"<filename>Tests.test_battery_energy_charge_mixed</filename>. On some "
"systems, two tests relating to the headphone hotplug feature are known to "
"fail. Those can be safely ignored since the functionality still works."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>LC_ALL=C ninja test</command>. A "
"suíte de teste deveria ser executada a partir de uma sessão GUI local "
"iniciada com dbus-launch. Em máquinas de 32 bits, um teste falhará devido a "
"erros de arredondamento: "
"<filename>Tests.test_battery_energy_charge_mixed</filename>. Em alguns "
"sistemas, dois testes relacionados ao recurso hotplug de fone de ouvido são "
"conhecidos por falharem. Eles podem ser ignorados com segurança, pois a "
"funcionalidade ainda funciona."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/upower.xml:200
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/upower.xml:203
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/upower.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/upower.xml:211
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D gtk-doc=false</parameter>: Prevents building the "
"documentation. Remove this if you have <application>GTK-Doc</application> "
"installed and wish to build the documentation."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D gtk-doc=false</parameter>: Impede construir a documentação. "
"Remova isso se você tiver o <application>GTK-Doc</application> instalado e "
"desejar construir a documentação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/upower.xml:217
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D man=false</parameter>: Prevents building the manual pages. "
"Remove this if you have <xref linkend='libxslt'/> and <xref "
"linkend='docbook-xsl'/> installed and wish to build the manual pages."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D man=false</parameter>: Impede construir as páginas de manual. "
"Remova isso se você tiver <xref linkend='libxslt'/> e <xref "
"linkend='docbook-xsl'/> instalados e desejar construir as páginas de manual."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/upower.xml:224
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D systemdsystemunitdir=no</parameter>: Removes the dependency on"
" <application>systemd</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D systemdsystemunitdir=no</parameter>: Remove a dependência do "
"<application>systemd</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/upower.xml:229
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D udevrulesdir=/usr/lib/udev/rules.d</parameter>: Tells the "
"build system where to install <application>udev</application> rules because "
"the information is missing in "
"<filename>/usr/lib/pkgconfig/libudev.pc</filename>"
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D udevrulesdir=/usr/lib/udev/rules.d</parameter>: Informa ao "
"sistema de construção onde instalar as regras do "
"<application>udev</application> porque as informações estão ausentes em "
"<filename>/usr/lib/pkgconfig/libudev.pc</filename>"

